  "notes": "{経|た}つ means for time to pass or elapse.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Intransitive ({自動詞|じどうし})\n- Pattern: {時間|じかん}が{経|た}つ (time passes)\n\nDISTINCTION FROM {立|た}つ:\n- {経|た}つ: time passing\n- {立|た}つ: to stand; to rise\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ～が{経|た}つ: time passes\n- ～{経|た}ってから: after ~ passes\n- {時間|じかん}が{経|た}つにつれて: as time passes\n- {何年|なんねん}も{経|た}っている: many years have passed\n\nASPECT (ている/た):\n- {経|た}っている: time has passed (current state)\n- {経|た}った: passed (completed)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {過|す}ぎる: to pass (time, place)\n- {流|なが}れる: to flow (time metaphorically)\n- {経|へ}る: to pass through, elapse (literary)",
